# Copy to .dev.vars for local development. Never commit .dev.vars.
# In production set these with `npx wrangler secret put <NAME>`.

# Any long random string. Clients send it as `Authorization: Bearer <API_KEY>`.
API_KEY=change-me

# Discogs personal access token: https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers
# Optional for lowest-listing prices; required for per-condition price suggestions.
DISCOGS_TOKEN=

# Which road Discogs calls take: "tunnel" (production, through a laptop's Cloudflare Tunnel) or
# "pool". Leave it unset locally: the vault then makes plain fetches, which from your machine
# reach Discogs from your own address. In production `npm run egress:here` / `egress:pool` set it.
# DISCOGS_ROAD=
